  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.17.0-alpha.8 - 2026-07-01\n\n### Features\n\n- Make scrollbars across the app match the current theme and respond more clearly to hover and click states (#1212)\n- Refresh the About settings page with a clearer updates area and sponsor actions (#1214)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Keep the Check for updates button stable while an update check is in progress (#1214)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.17.0-alpha.8 - 2026-07-01\n\n### Features\n\n- 让应用内滚动条跟随当前主题，并在悬停和点击时呈现更清晰的状态 (#1212)\n- 优化“关于”设置页，更新区域更清晰，并加入赞助相关操作 (#1214)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复检查更新期间“检查更新”按钮显示不稳定的问题 (#1214)",
